		(property "Note" "Q1 Vgs clamp. REQUIRED, not optional: when D1 (SMBJ24A) clamps a transient at 38.9V the unclamped Vgs would be -38.9V against Q1 typical +/-20V limit. Cathode to +12V (Q1 source), anode to Q1 gate. Does not conduct in normal operation - at 14.4V the Vgs magnitude is below the 15V knee - so the circuit has zero quiescent draw. 15V chosen so nothing clamps during ordinary running while still leaving margin to +/-20V."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left)
			)
		)
