	(text "J2 rev 2.1: two-level 2x6 block (part open: CANary-HAT-Rev2.1.md open item 34).\nPins 1-6 = LOWER level, rev 2.0's J2 pin for pin (do not re-land the vehicle harness).\nPins 7-12 = UPPER level, sensor ports (13.5.5, 13.5.11): 7 5V_SENS, 8 SENS_V1 (voltage port),\n9 SENS_R1 (resistive port), 10/11 FUEL_P/FUEL_GND, 12 SENS_GND.\nPin 11 FUEL_GND is the gauge's analog minus (ADS8688A AIN_4GND), NOT a ground."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b68d7b72-ed04-4180-ba4c-152147f67748")
	)
	)
